WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:02.501
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers,
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:03.570
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:06.506
And now we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.440
According to ex-White House
press secretary

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:11.177
Stephanie Grisham's new book,
former president Trump

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:14.313
was once asked to go
vegan for charity,

00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:16.549
but if you didn't lose him
at "vegan,"

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:19.485
I'm sure you lost him
at "charity."

00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:21.855
In the same book, former
Trump administration staffer

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:24.757
Stephanie Grisham
describes The White House as

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:27.226
"A clown car on fire
running at full speed

00:00:27.226 --> 00:00:29.562
into a warehouse
full of fireworks."

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:30.997
But she apparently
doesn't mention

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:34.433
the part where
she called "Shotgun!"

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:36.703
Former President Trump,
last week, called in to a

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:41.073
prophecy-focused conservative
Christian talk show and said

00:00:41.073 --> 00:00:44.611
"Nobody has done more for
Christianity or for Evangelicals

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:47.680
or for religion itself
than I have."

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.415
Really? Nobody?

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:51.017
You can't think of
a single person?

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:53.219
Jesus Christ.

00:00:54.853 --> 00:00:57.456
Former President Trump
reportedly tells people

00:00:57.456 --> 00:01:00.893
constantly that he is running
for president in 2024.

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:03.729
Well, he doesn't tell everyone.

00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:05.965
[ As Trump ]
It's your year, Mike.

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:07.733
After postponing
last week's vote on

00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:09.535
the bipartisan
infrastructure package,

00:01:09.535 --> 00:01:12.038
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi,
on Saturday,

00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:15.207
set a new Halloween deadline,
because nothing is spookier

00:01:15.207 --> 00:01:19.411
to Democrats than actually
passing legislation.

00:01:19.411 --> 00:01:22.014
According to a recent survey,
10% of Americans said

00:01:22.014 --> 00:01:25.418
that they feel very pessimistic
about the rest of 2021,

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:29.888
while the other 90% said,
"It's 2021?"

00:01:29.888 --> 00:01:32.992
Clint Eastwood, on Friday,
won a $6 million lawsuit

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.527
against a Lithuanian company

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:37.764
that used his image
to promote CBD products.

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.832
I'm not sure how
they used his image,

00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:42.936
but I'm guessing as "before"?

00:01:45.504 --> 00:01:47.940
Passengers on
a Spirit Airlines plane in

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:50.543
Atlantic City, New Jersey,
were forced to deplane

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:54.113
over the weekend after a large
bird caused an engine fire.

00:01:54.113 --> 00:01:58.017
And this is sad -- that bird
still had a better time

00:01:58.017 --> 00:02:02.254
than everyone who spent
the weekend in Atlantic City.

00:02:02.254 --> 00:02:04.624
According to a new book,
former First Lady Melania Trump

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:06.825
obsessively read
her own press coverage,

00:02:06.825 --> 00:02:08.461
because you can
only re-read your

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:10.863
marriage contract so many times.

00:02:10.863 --> 00:02:12.632
And, finally,
according to a new survey,

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:15.768
42% of Americans
said that they feel bad

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:17.870
if they don't do
anything productive all day.

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:21.173
Fortunately, clicking
this counts as productive.

00:02:21.173 --> 00:02:22.575
And that was a monologue.

